    "identifier": "medical-release-ensnaring-strike",
    "description": "<p>The next time you hit a creature with a melee or ranged weapon or unarmed attack before this jutsu ends, you inject chakra into your enemy’s muscles attempting to restrict their movements. The target must make a Strength saving throw or be Restrained until the end of their next turn. A large or larger creature has advantage on the saving throw. While Restrained by this jutsu, the target takes 1d8 poison damage at the start of each of its turns.     At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8</p>",
